cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "RegressSelect"
abstract: "Regression test selection and prioritisation for numerical suites, scored on what skipping costs — import-graph reachability as the safe baseline, historical co-failure prioritisation measured by APFD, and a learned ranker over change features, all three evaluated by seeded fault injection into a bundled sample project on faults-detected against tests-run with the full-suite upper bound shown, and safety-loss (the fraction of real failures a selection would have missed) reported as the number that decides usability."
type: software
